MID_SE_Esm_Dai_C: <EDH>
MID_SE_Esm_Dai_C_001: Hm, where should I eat? All the food in Dagsion is so\ngood. Hard to decide...
MID_SE_Esm_Dai_C_002: Well, whatever! Guess I'll have to work my way\nthrough all the places, starting with this one!
MID_SE_Esm_Dai_C_003: So it was you making all that noise, Dadao. What's\nthe racket about?
MID_SE_Esm_Dai_C_004: Ohhhh, it's you! Hi, Esmeralda! Eeheehee.
MID_SE_Esm_Dai_C_005: Why are you being so weird? Out with it. I don't\nhave all day here.
MID_SE_Esm_Dai_C_006: Aw, c'mon, don't be like that! I was just admiring\nyour beauty... You're really pretty.
MID_SE_Esm_Dai_C_007: Are you kidding? Because I'm not in the\nmood for jokes.
MID_SE_Esm_Dai_C_008: I'm serious! I've thought so ever since I first saw you!
MID_SE_Esm_Dai_C_009: Sha Lan and the others were suspicious of you. They\nthought maybe you were an ally of Vritra.
MID_SE_Esm_Dai_C_010: But I don't care about all that! I don't even really\nunderstand the whole Vritra thing.
MID_SE_Esm_Dai_C_011: So you're not kidding. Honestly, I'm surprised you\neven noticed me over Fabio's grumbling.
MID_SE_Esm_Dai_C_012: Still, "pretty." Can't complain, I guess. With all these\ncity girls around, it feels nice to get noticed.
MID_SE_Esm_Dai_C_013: Yeah, there ya go! Oh, and I definitely wanna make\nyou my woman!
MID_SE_Esm_Dai_C_014: Wait, what? Say that again.
MID_SE_Esm_Dai_C_015: Er, uh, the last thing? That I wanna make you\nmy woman?
MID_SE_Esm_Dai_C_016: What's wrong? You look kinda...scary now. Anyway,\nif you're hungry, we could go grab a bite.
MID_SE_Esm_Dai_C_017: OK, fine. I'll spell it out, and maybe you'll get it.\nYou're treating me like something to collect!
MID_SE_Esm_Dai_C_018: Eat with you? Who even wants to breathe the same\nair as you? I'm going to hurl!
MID_SE_Esm_Dai_C_019: Hey, what's gotten into you! You were fine up till\nnow... And she's gone.
MID_SE_Esm_Dai_C_020: Well, this sucks. I don't know what I did, but she\nreally went off on me...
MID_SE_Esm_Dai_C_021: This is confusing, and I'm hungry. Food first. Then\nmaybe I'll figure out what happened.
MID_SE_Esm_Dai_B: <EDH>
MID_SE_Esm_Dai_B_001: You wanted to talk? I'm not exactly in the mood for\nyour nonsense. So what is it?
MID_SE_Esm_Dai_B_002: I want to apologize for whatever I did that made you\nangry. Also, can you tell me what I did?
MID_SE_Esm_Dai_B_003: I've been trying so hard to figure it out, but I have no\nidea where I went wrong!
MID_SE_Esm_Dai_B_004: And then when I think that hard, I start to get super\nhungry, and it's all just a lot. Please help.
MID_SE_Esm_Dai_B_005: {SetColor=Gray}Well, will you take a look at this. He has no idea. He\njust asks. At least he's apologizing.{SetColor=Default}
MID_SE_Esm_Dai_B_006: When you say, "make me your woman," it shows me\nyou're thinking about YOU, not about me.
MID_SE_Esm_Dai_B_007: What do you mean? I'm just telling you how I feel.\nThat's normal, isn't it?
MID_SE_Esm_Dai_B_008: Ugh. Look, it's how you put it. You're not the first\nguy who's tried to make me his—in that way.
MID_SE_Esm_Dai_B_009: That one was complete scum. He tried to kill me—\njust because I wouldn't be his woman.
MID_SE_Esm_Dai_B_010: What the hell! That doesn't make any sense!\nIt makes me so mad!
MID_SE_Esm_Dai_B_011: You're really getting worked up. Take it easy there,\nbig guy. Where are you going with your club?
MID_SE_Esm_Dai_B_012: I don't like it! I don't like it one bit! Hraaugh!
MID_SE_Esm_Dai_B_013: Killing the woman you love is wrong! You're\nsupposed to protect her at all costs!
MID_SE_Esm_Dai_B_015: Dadao... I think I get it now.
MID_SE_Esm_Dai_B_016: You're not like Randa. You don't know when to shut\nup...but you're basically a good guy.
MID_SE_Esm_Dai_B_017: A...good...guy? Does that mean you'll be my woman?!
MID_SE_Esm_Dai_B_018: What? No. That has nothing to do with what I\njust said.
MID_SE_Esm_Dai_B_019: I'll do a super good job protecting you! I'm really\nstrong, I swear!
MID_SE_Esm_Dai_B_020: You know, I'm probably stronger than you. Give me\nthat club.
MID_SE_Esm_Dai_B_021: Hmm, this one will do... Ha!
MID_SE_Esm_Dai_B_022: That boulder was bigger than the one I smashed...\nand you didn't even break a sweat...
MID_SE_Esm_Dai_B_023: Oh, sorry. Looks like I dinged your club. Let me\nknow how much it costs to fix.
MID_SE_Esm_Dai_B_024: Why is my love life always such a mess?!